+// Incoming-characteristic electric penalty.  In a planar 1D wave, E_t=-n x B_t
+// is the outgoing solution. Relaxing E_t toward that value leaves this exact
+// outgoing characteristic unchanged and attenuates the incoming one. Magnetic
